@startuml quality-gates

' PO 2026-09-12: ortho routing keeps the six-stage chain left-to-right without any curve
' crossing the two release-tag gates that run side by side (security job / sonarqube job in
' .forgejo/workflows/cicd.yml). Falls back to polyline if a label ever gets covered.
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 110
skinparam ranksep 120
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Roboto, Segoe UI, sans-serif"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam wrapWidth 190

skinparam rectangle {
  FontSize 12
}
skinparam rectangle<<endpoint>> {
  BackgroundColor #9AA0A6
  BorderColor #74787C
  FontColor #202124
  roundCorner 0
}
skinparam rectangle<<stage>> {
  BackgroundColor #3C88EB
  BorderColor #2D66B0
  FontColor #202124
  roundCorner 0
}
skinparam rectangle<<gate>> {
  BackgroundColor #1A73E8
  BorderColor #1456AE
  FontColor #ffffff
  roundCorner 0
}
skinparam note {
  FontSize 11
  BackgroundColor #FEF5E0
  BorderColor #E65100
  FontColor #202124
}
skinparam arrow {
  FontSize 11
  Color #5F6368
  FontColor #202124
}

rectangle "Commit\n(git commit)" as Commit <<endpoint>>
rectangle "Local · make test\nJaCoCo 90/90 line+branch\nktlint · detekt · sqlfluff" as LocalTest <<stage>>
rectangle "Push / PR\nForgejo test.yml: make test\n(same gates, shared runner)" as Push <<stage>>
rectangle "Release tag v*\nGitleaks (full history)\nTrivy fs (.trivyignore.yaml)" as Security <<gate>>
rectangle "Release tag v*\nSonarQube CE\n(Maven plugin, JaCoCo coverage)" as Sonar <<gate>>
rectangle "Publish\nmake publish / publish-images.yml\nTrivy image gate" as Publish <<gate>>
rectangle "Deploy\n(pull image, Ubuntu server)" as Deploy <<endpoint>>

' Column pinning: Security/Sonar stacked in the same release-tag column so neither arrow
' into or out of Publish has to cross the other.
Security -[hidden]down- Sonar

Commit -right-> LocalTest : pre-commit hook\n(Gitleaks)
LocalTest -right-> Push : git push
Push -right-> Security : release tag
Push -right-> Sonar : release tag
Security -right-> Publish : tag passes
Sonar -right-> Publish : tag passes
Publish -right-> Deploy : image pushed

note bottom of Sonar
  False positives: Product Owner decision.
  CDI findings: always resolved
  architecturally, never excluded.
end note

@enduml
